@startuml cu08
!theme plain
title CU08 — Ingresar nuevo cliente

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to register a new client.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (First name; Last name; Identification type and number; Nationality; Date of birth; Marital status; Occupation; Address; Phone; E-mail)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the requested data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Records the entered data and creates a new client.
System -> System : System

@enduml